Model weights
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
With one exception (the "Hey Lashon" wake-word classifier, below), no model
weights are committed to this repository or bundled in the installer. The
Hebrew speech-to-text model (ivrit-ai/whisper-large-v3-turbo-ct2, Apache-2.0)
is downloaded on first run and verified against models/manifests/stt.json. The
Silero VAD model (MIT) and the openWakeWord shared melspectrogram + embedding
models (Apache-2.0) are likewise downloaded on first run and verified against
models/manifests/m6-audio.json. Only MIT/Apache-licensed models are eligible
to bundle; CC-BY-NC and CPML models are offered as opt-in downloads with a
non-commercial badge, never bundled. See docs/providers.md (bundle policy).

